  "atomic_questions": [
    "Since the objective is to minimize the number of containers and leftover goods are simply not loaded, is it acceptable for the model to use zero containers and ship nothing, or must at least one container be used?"
  ],
  "rationale": "The response contains a single clarification question asking for a policy choice between allowing zero containers or requiring at least one."
}

